{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And in Salem was His tabernacle</b> — This is Jerusalem. Perhaps it was called thus because it is complete, corresponding to the gate of heaven, or because it is worthy to be in peace, or they called it thus by way of prayer, as in: \"Pray for the peace of Jerusalem.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 76, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:37.620222367Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}